---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout>
  <div class="careers-container">
    <h1>Lavora Con Noi</h1>
    
    <div class="content">
      <section class="intro">
        <h2 class="section-header">Unisciti al Team Tundha</h2>
        <p>Siamo sempre alla ricerca di persone appassionate che condividano i nostri valori e il nostro amore per la pizza di qualità. Se credi nella filosofia della pizza come deve essere, potresti essere la persona giusta per il nostro team.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="application-section">
        <h2 class="section-header">Come Candidarsi</h2>
        <p>Se sei interessato a far parte del nostro team, inviaci il tuo curriculum vitae e una breve lettera di presentazione.</p>
        
        <div class="contact-methods">
          <a href="mailto:info@pbread.it?subject=Candidatura - Tundha" class="method-link">
            <div class="method">
              <h3>Via Email</h3>
              <div class="contact-link">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
                  <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
                </svg>
                <span>info@pbread.it</span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
          
          <a href="https://maps.app.goo.gl/mDKfv4KFkKoR4Jc16" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="method-link">
            <div class="method">
              <h3>Di Persona</h3>
              <div class="address">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                  <path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path>
                  <circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle>
                </svg>
                <div>
                  <span>Viale Cristoforo Colombo, 2D</span>
                  <span>Cagliari</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .careers-container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 8rem 2rem 3rem;
    color: var(--white);
    min-height: 100vh;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--brand-font);
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .content {
    line-height: 1.8;
    font-family: var(--base-font);
  }

  section {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 0;
  }

  .intro {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  h2 {
    font-family: var(--brand-font);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: center;
  }

  h3 {
    font-family: var(--brand-font);
    color: var(--gold);
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  p {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.95;
  }


  .application-section {
    background: rgba(155, 55, 30, 0.15);
    padding: 2rem;
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .contact-methods {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
    margin: 2rem 0;
  }

  .method-link {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
    display: block;
    transition: transform 0.3s ease;
  }

  .method-link:hover {
    transform: scale(1.05);
  }

  .method-link:hover .method {
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
  }

  .method-link:hover .contact-link,
  .method-link:hover .address {
    color: var(--gold);
  }

  .method {
    padding: 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
    border-radius: 0.5rem;
    transition: background 0.3s ease;
    height: 100%;
  }

  .contact-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--white);
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .address {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--white);
    transition: color 0.3s ease;
  }

  .address div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .address span {
    display: block;
  }


  @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {
    .careers-container {
      padding: 6rem 1.5rem 2rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: 1.3rem;
    }

    .content {
      line-height: 1.6;
    }


    .contact-methods {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {
    .careers-container {
      padding: 5rem 1rem 1.5rem;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 1.75rem;
    }

  }
</style>
